  "notes": "**Hutsix v3.7.0**(released)\n\n### Running Profiles\n- **Fixed: closing a Hutsix window restarted a profile you had paused.** If you pressed the global **Pause** hotkey and then opened and closed any Hutsix window, the profile went back to watching the screen even though input was still paused. The status line showed the profile as active and the triggers kept matching, but every action was silently dropped, so nothing happened in the game. A pause now belongs to whoever asked for it: the profile only starts acting again when every pause has been lifted.",
